 signs of aging. NAD+ (Nicotinamide Adenine Dinucleotide) is a powerful antioxidant that supports cellular repair and energy production, helping your skin restore its youthful vibrancy. Meanwhile, EGF (Epidermal Growth Factor) stimulates your skin’s natural regeneration processes, promoting faster cell turnover and healthier tissue development. This multi-faceted formula is perfect for individuals who notice their skin losing firmness, developing fine lines, experiencing dullness, or feeling less elastic over time. Whether you''re concerned about wrinkles around the eyes, forehead, mouth, or neck, or simply want to enhance your overall skin resilience, this serum acts as a potent support to your anti-aging routine. It’s ideal for those seeking visible improvements without heaviness or irritation, including sensitive or troubled skin types. Key features include a sophisticated Collagen Firming Complex that works synergistically with EGF peptides and NAD+ to hydrate, tighten, and restore skin elasticity. These ingredients help reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, while boosting firmness and resilience for a smoother, more youthful look. Additionally, the serum targets rough skin textures and uneven tone, revealing a brighter, healthier, and more radiant skin surface. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing texture ensures the serum penetrates quickly, delivering concentrated benefits without leaving a greasy or sticky residue. It''s suitable for daily use across all skin types and is non-comedogenic and dermatologist-tested, providing peace of mind for sensitive skin. Beyond its visible benefits, this serum can boost your confidence by helping you look and feel more vibrant, youthful, and radiant. As your skin becomes increasingly firm, plump, and luminous, you’ll experience a renewed sense of assurance in your natural beauty. It empowers you to take control of aging naturally and effectively, making skincare an inspiring act of self-care. What sets this formula 