before/after or progression photos, only labeled images of facial areas.","No INCI or ingredient list is present in the image.","The image clearly lists the benefits and ingredients as described in the facts.","The concentration ''5% VOLUFILINE'' is explicitly shown on the product and in the text.","There is no before/after photographic comparison, so comparisonVerified is false.","An unsupported ingredient statement was withheld.","The image contains only a single model and does not provide before/after photographs or any explicit comparison of results.","There are no labeled regions or paired images to verify a before/after transformation.","The text claims clinical results but does not visually demonstrate them with photographic evidence.","The image contains clear, readable text matching the provided facts about product benefits and the presence of 5% Volufiline.","The product name ''medicube PDRN PINK COLLAGEN VOLUME MULTI BALM'' is visible and matches the facts.","There is no visible INCI list or full ingredient list, so only the explicitly named ingredients and concentrations can be verified.","The image contains clear, verbatim benefit claims for each product as listed in the facts.","There is no before/after comparison, no timeline, and no photographic evidence of efficacy—only product images and marketing claims.","The OCR text matches the ingredient list fact exactly, confirming the presence and order of all listed ingredients.","The entire INCI list is fully visible and clearly labeled as ''Ingredients''.","No concentrations or functions are claimed, only ingredient presence.","Shopify metafields are not readable through the existing Storefront permissions.","Full ingredient information is being verified.","Application instructions require manual verification.","Unconfirmed image-derived information is awaiting review."],"updatedAt":"2026-10-10T20:50:49.389Z"}'::jsonb, '{"productId":"10691183181964","handle":"youthful-glow-multi-balm-stick","title":"Youthful Glow Multi-Balm Stick","fingerprint":"3993e85f61e0ca454200cfe5159491db6ed6de42270318b556ed7433300bf5a4","category":"skincare","status":"needs_review","facts":[],"comparisons":[],"imagesTotal":8,"imagesInspected":8,"reasons":[],"updatedAt":"2026-10-10T20:50:49.389Z"}'::jsonb, 'needs_review', '2026-10-10T20:50:49.389Z'::timestamptz) ON CONFLICT (product_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO product_image_analysis (product_id, fingerprint, source, work, information, published, status, updated_at) VALUES ('10691183247500', '433f1c3d675ecd5f86efb604df2e6364703b50fb6b988524ebb825a63ff3ec98', '{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/10691183247500","title":"Radiance & Resilience Collagen Cream","handle":"radiance-resilience-collagen-cream","productType":"","vendor":"Maison & Co.","description":"This luxurious cream is specially crafted to dramatically improve your skin’s appearance, leaving it deeply hydrated, firmer, and more resilient. Its unique formulation works by infusing your skin with a potent blend of science-backed actives, including collagen, niacinamide, and carefully chosen nourishing oils. These ingredients work together to restore your skin’s youthful vitality, strengthening its natural barrier and visibly reducing the signs of aging. Designed for women who want to maintain a vibrant, youthful glow, this product tackles common skin concerns like loss of elasticity, dullness, uneven tone, enlarged pores, and dark spots. Whether you''re seeking to slow down the visible effects of aging or simply want smoother, more radiant skin, this cream is your perfect daily ally. It’s especially ideal for mature or sensitive skin types looking for a gentle yet effective solution. One of its standout features is the powerful combination of up to 16 patented ingredients, which ensure rapid and noticeable results—sometimes within just two weeks. Watch as your skin becomes visibly plumper, more elastic, and beautifully refined. This lightweight formula provides intense hydration that lasts all day without feeling greasy or heavy, making it suitable for even the most sensitive skin. Enjoy peace of mind knowing it’s dermatologically tested and free from 15 harmful ingredients, emphasizing both safety and effectiveness. It acts as a shield against environmental stressors while delivering essential nutrients to keep your skin resilient and healthy. Regular use of this cream empowers you with increased confidence, helping you wake up to skin that looks and feels more youthful, vibrant, and radiant each morning. Its scientifically advanced, natural oils, and patented ingredients elevate your self-care routine to a luxurious, results-driven experience. Plus, its versatility allows you to blend it with other products for a personalized skincare regime that fits your unique needs. This is more than just a moisturizer — it’s a transformative skincare solution that delivers rapid, visible results, restores your skin’s natural beauty, and boosts your confidence at any age.","descriptionHtml":"This luxurious cream is specially crafted to dramatically improve your skin’s appearance, leaving it deeply hydrated, firmer, and more resilient. Its unique formulation works by infusing your skin with a potent blend of science-backed actives, including collagen, niacinamide, and carefully chosen nourishing oils. These ingredients work together to restore your skin’s youthful vitality, strengthening its natural barrier and visibly reducing the signs of aging.\n\nDesigned for women who want to maintain a vibrant, youthful glow, this product tackles common skin concerns like loss of elasticity, dullness, uneven tone, enlarged pores, and dark spots. Whether you''re seeking to slow down the visible effects of aging or simply want smoother, more radiant skin, this cream is your perfect daily ally. It’s especially ideal for mature or sensitive skin types looking for a gentle yet effective solution.\n\nOne of its standout features is the powerful combination of up to 16 patented ingredients, which ensure rapid and noticeable results—sometimes within just two weeks. Watch as your skin becomes visibly plumper, more elastic, and beautifully refined. This lightweight formula provides intense hydration that lasts all day without feeling greasy or heavy, making it suitable for even the most sensitive skin.\n\nEnjoy peace of mind knowing it’s dermatologically tested and free from 15 harmful ingredients, emphasizing both safety and effectiveness. It acts as a shield against environmental stressors while delivering essential nutrients to keep your skin resilient and healthy.\n\nRegular use of this cream empowers you with increased confidence, helping you wake up to skin that looks and feels more youthful, vibrant, and radiant each morning. Its scientifically advanced, natural oils, and patented ingredients elevate your self-care routine to a luxurious, results-driven experience. Plus, its versatility allows you to blend it with other products for a personalized skincare regime that fits your unique needs.\n\nThis is more than just a moisturizer — it’s a transformative skincare solution that delivers rapid, visible results, restores your skin’s natural beauty, and boosts your confidence at any age.","tags":[],"updatedAt":"2026-10-10T12:25:05Z","productId":"10691183247500","metadata":[],"metadataAccessible":false,"images":[{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductImage/52071096811660","url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/9570/0364/files/61qcv-tUtDL._SL1500.jpg?v=1791303436","width":1500,"height":1500,"altText":null},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductImage/52071096844428","url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/9570/0364/files/71jQzTsRJvL._SL1500.jpg?v=1791303435","width":1500,"height":1500,"altText":null},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductImage/52071096877196","url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/9570/0364/files/71ou2jmH3lL._SL1500.jpg?v=1791303436","width":1500,"height":1500,"altText":null},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductImage/52071096909964","url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/9570/0364/files/71EmME5GGJL._SL1500.jpg?v=1791303436","width":1500,"height":1500,"altText":null},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductImage/52071096942732","url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/9570/0364/files/711zCF4YWBL._SL1500.jpg?v=1791303436","width":1500,"height":1500,"altText":null},{"id":"gid://shopify/ProductImage/52071096975500","url